{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ee3a8eed57413ba35bdef9f9971179dabd91446402a344e8fcbe312513ec1f3",
      "text": "……啊！糟了！仔细想想，我这还是\n第一次在粉丝面前展现这种打扮呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63a7ad37322e53c378bf616bfc7618edc1289e449ae7b6cd45e1c3d1d8152b95",
      "text": "你们两个，我看起来有没有哪里怪怪的？\n或者说，真的适合我吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:972c2f91c5092d72bf1de8c024aeba9e28f3a06409dcb1073c3d830eb979f102",
      "text": "秋山。事到如今才问这个，未免太迟了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c7694af25f9188f96bbd9073676bf3d803a4a9bbf07094fdaa09b298e8d9020",
      "text": "真是的。和你平时在演出时弹吉他的样子相比，\n简直判若两人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa31aa29d3db460babedee2777208ddaa3b8e39bc546f773bdfda169f1ff92fb",
      "text": "哎！锐心，你看过我们的演出吗！？\n谢谢，我超开心的！……不对，现在不是说这个的时候！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11df6c111fe7eb97c636a1d163a25788e13127984a817c89344f2e7e7c4684d3",
      "text": "马上就要正式开拍了耶！？会介意也是理所当然的吧！\n我也想让大家看到自己帅气的一面啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e071848654019968e1712564dd6ae18647e60971a55578f3fb1e78cf4425437",
      "text": "没事的啦，隼人先生！\n无论是这身行头还是发型，都帅得无懈可击！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea30a362f1e20893b81445180e1d1102ee08487a5349cb798076dffc48d57bdb",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了……发型也是\n多亏了从朱雀那里借来的发蜡呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7055fd927699d1d553678cedfb2a1709ff8c4c4fe994d62e6c7eb6506011d77b",
      "text": "之前你好像也提过这件事。\n那东西真有这么好用吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea5f43e1e4db3a25d7b497b2d09df4a3a61df8fa0b427a10331ddd6518b9d39",
      "text": "是啊，抓型效果绝了！\n锐心先生，不介意的话要不要也用用看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:982699386813aeedd912700363a10e816fdb7ab4fa1474857f94d40c09d61969",
      "text": "那么，我就稍微借用一下。\n……原来如此，用起来的手感确实不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9098e5a45a81b683c11dbaf8ba6830d7351423df71e0d1d85a9486a435138b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，是吧？毕竟可是本大爷的爱用品啊。\n顺便问问，锐心先生平时都用什么样的啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eacf4aef8fd93efe6a9d8ea8c40b3cc29156fa99f94d528579c0b22af992ee16",
      "text": "都是父母或熟人推荐给我的款式。\n我自己倒没有特别的讲究……不过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1504e72a03151d4be2be5b29794c7181c8540e81cb1e14e185960fc2e5c58d",
      "text": "唯独会注意不要让香味太浓。\n特别是在与人一同用餐的时候。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
